     4157                   view-as alert-box question buttons ok-cancel update g#log.
     4158               if not g#log then do:   find shar-buf_ord-doc where recid (shar-buf_ord-doc) = doc-rec no-lock.   return no-apply. end.
     4159               IF NOT AVAILABLE shar-buf_ord-doc THEN RETURN .
