     7699             l-query-was-opened = true
     7700           .
     7701       end.
     7702     end.
     7703     if l-filter-open-73 = false then do:
     7704       OPEN QUERY br-docs FOR EACH shar-buf_ord-doc no-lock
     7705         where  shar-buf_ord-doc.host-code = g#host-code
     7706          USE-INDEX ByFirm
